    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Home Highlights:<br>- GULF side and across from the Seaside Town Square<br>- STEPS to the beach with access to private East Ruskin Pavilion<br>- Ocean views on every floor<br>- Elevator services all floors of this cottage (residential elevator, not wheelchair accessible)<br>- Living spaces with TVs on all 3 floors<br>- Two adult sized beach cruiser bikes<br>- You will have a total of 14 RFID access cards for access to the private beaches in Seaside.<br>- Fully stocked Kitchen with additional coffee bars<br>- Sandpiper Linen Program Participant: All linen, bedding and bath, are the highest quality. <br>- There is an additional cost to use the 3 pools and fitness center in Seaside. The cost for this cottage is $140/day. Please alert us after booking should you wish to add the \"Seaside Amenity Passes\" to your reservation. <br><br><br>Seaya is a breathtaking, GULF SIDE 5 bedroom, 3-story cottage with water views on every floor! This sprawling beach retreat offers 3 KING master retreats with private baths, spacious designer kitchen with high end appliances throughout, living rooms on every floor with wet bars and breakfast nooks flanking the bedrooms, upscale technology & TVs throughout, and an elevator to help you reach each level with ease. <br><br>Conveniently located across from the Seaside square. Seaya sits just one cottage back from the beach offering the easiest beach access in Seaside! The first floor boasts 2 bedrooms; one with two sets of bunk beds (sleeps 4) and the other with two double beds (sleeps 4) with new bedding. Each room has its own private full bathrooms. A sitting room in the middle with flat screen TV separates the two bedrooms. The second floor offers a spacious living room with another area to watch TV and French doors take you to a sprawling balcony with breathtaking gulf views. Just off the living room is an over-sized gourmet kitchen and dining room. Stainless appliances and a high-end range will delight the chef in the family, while the eat-in kitchen has dining space for 10 and bar seating for 3 allowing the whole family to gather for those beach-side dinners.<br><br>Up one more level to the third floor, guests will enjoy a third living room, wet bar/breakfast bar, flat screen TV and decorative fireplace. A 2nd KING master suite is on this level with beautiful master bath and designer tub. A 3rd KING master suite is also on this level with full bath. Just off the bedrooms is another sprawling balcony with outdoor dining space and lounge seating. <br><br>Accommodations: (sleeps 14)<br>First Floor:<br>Bedroom 1: Two double beds (sleeps up to 4), private full bathroom with tub/shower combo<br>Bedroom 2: Two sets of Twin bunk beds (sleeps 4), private full bathroom with tub/shower combo, TV. <br>A sitting room in the middle with flat screen TV separates the two bedrooms. Laundree room is on first floor.<br>Second Floor:<br>Bedroom 3: Master suite- King bed, private bath (shower only), TV <br>Fully stocked kitchen, half bath, Living area with TV<br>Third Floor:<br>Bedroom 4: Master Suite- King bed, beautiful ensuite master bath and designer tub, TV<br>Bedroom 5: Master Suite- King bed, ensuite full bathroom, TV<br>Living area with additional seating between the 2 king suites, TV<br><br>** There is an additional cost to use the 3 pools and fitness center in Seaside. The cost for this cottage is $140/day. Please alert us after booking should you wish to add the \"Seaside Amenity Passes\" to your reservation. <br>* Additional fees are required to reserve Pickleball and Tennis courts paid directly to the Seaside amenity Center. <br>* Seaside Chapel with Sunday services, Walkable Town Center from rental home including shopping, restaurants and upscale grocery market.<br><br>FREE WiFi",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
